window.EXAUD={"We need to take action to keep our school clean.": "audio/cau/0c8076052760d1f1.mp3", "Lan is very active, and her quick action helped her friend.": "audio/cau/aa0ee4199314c27b.mp3", "My little brother is very active.": "audio/cau/ee888778c322e79a.mp3", "Hoa is active and enjoys every club activity.": "audio/cau/a7bbb816806174db.mp3", "We do many fun activities at the weekend.": "audio/cau/996d76bf4c31cea3.mp3", "Mi is very active and loves outdoor activities.": "audio/cau/94fea0819039eaa4.mp3", "Swimming is my favourite activity.": "audio/cau/f1504092a266a13a.mp3", "Hoa is an active girl, and dancing is her best activity.": "audio/cau/3d7dcf03c6c96451.mp3", "Hoa is always polite when she talks to adults.": "audio/cau/30f664238e37dbc6.mp3", "Adults need about eight hours of sleep.": "audio/cau/965ef8331141619a.mp3", "We must keep our traditional crafts alive.": "audio/cau/461c910cfd0f1264.mp3", "The old tree is still alive, but that one is dead.": "audio/cau/713514d344b69a38.mp3", "My parents allow me to play games at weekends.": "audio/cau/0e78db317452b06e.mp3", "The park doesn't allow bikes; it bans them.": "audio/cau/cf368ad5bb4a58ec.mp3", "I am a student at Kim Dong School.": "audio/cau/7c9effe742362b92.mp3", "I am in Class 6A, and my friends are in 6B.": "audio/cau/69bce6abc68e1822.mp3", "Please answer the teacher's question.": "audio/cau/f790ccdd60f40ece.mp3", "Nam asks and Hoa answers.": "audio/cau/128cffcafde831b9.mp3", "Mai answered all the questions in the quiz.": "audio/cau/c93d065e33503510.mp3", "Khoa answered \"Yes\" to question 3.": "audio/cau/0f875ac2987d5d20.mp3", "Check your answers with a partner.": "audio/cau/8656910f569b2925.mp3", "Lan can answer all the questions, and her answers are correct.": "audio/cau/df2a478d26596242.mp3", "Lan eats an apple every morning.": "audio/cau/79c041305a2e80c6.mp3", "Apple is a big company that makes phones and computers.": "audio/cau/d8d1d310f9c383bb.mp3", "Mi and Nam are in Class 6A.": "audio/cau/b0d165e52ca7dc85.mp3", "We are happy today, and Lan is happy too.": "audio/cau/9718e7702bade08e.mp3", "They aren't at home now.": "audio/cau/6f3733b344f72b2c.mp3", "We aren't late; we are early.": "audio/cau/66e583dcb1eb30f3.mp3", "You can ask your teacher for help.": "audio/cau/675c99f05fae3d5e.mp3", "Phong asked a question, and Mi answered it.": "audio/cau/ad374096f949206b.mp3", "Nam asked his teacher a question.": "audio/cau/4879a0b703b8484f.mp3", "Mi asks a lot of questions; yesterday she asked ten.": "audio/cau/1884bf7fdb16c86c.mp3", "Lan is asking her mother about dinner.": "audio/cau/28eda1c06b5eacae.mp3", "Nam asks a lot, and now he is asking again.": "audio/cau/c563c3f4819710c9.mp3", "Minh asks his friend for a pen.": "audio/cau/463760cf3bb33508.mp3", "Hoa often asks questions, and yesterday she asked ten.": "audio/cau/99ce048ae007844f.mp3", "Look at picture b and answer.": "audio/cau/b2672a8a1898ddda.mp3", "Write the letter b next to the right answer.": "audio/cau/9ec7b58bf879e0bc.mp3", "Eating too much sugar is bad for your teeth.": "audio/cau/385b55508b3849c3.mp3", "The traffic was bad today, but yesterday it was worse.": "audio/cau/4db5861a9ee30736.mp3", "The city was badly affected by the flood.": "audio/cau/1e256308778b183a.mp3", "Nam played badly today, but yesterday he played worse.": "audio/cau/c2078c45e0d95aa8.mp3", "There is a banana on the table.": "audio/cau/4b32a815ce7c415c.mp3", "Lan eats a banana, and her brother eats two bananas.": "audio/cau/402d6fa42a7db173.mp3", "Please be quiet in the library.": "audio/cau/d6fab02a2655be4e.mp3", "I want to be a doctor. My sister is a nurse.": "audio/cau/e31166f3ca032296.mp3", "Our lessons begin at seven o'clock.": "audio/cau/7e2700abcf553879.mp3", "The film began at 8 p.m. and finished at 10 p.m.": "audio/cau/27d24f5e96b08bae.mp3", "At the beginning of the year, we make plans.": "audio/cau/8f5e00d9babf5811.mp3", "Read the beginning of the story and guess the end.": "audio/cau/04bc139456de0bed.mp3", "Our school has a big garden.": "audio/cau/6b86817f41024790.mp3", "My house is big, but Minh's house is bigger.": "audio/cau/1d7d2b8d19284673.mp3", "The film was long and boring.": "audio/cau/2fb37c98bad76a4f.mp3", "The lesson was boring, so Nam felt bored.": "audio/cau/0b9b11807d964d8b.mp3", "My mother bought me a new bag.": "audio/cau/393d28dd65ad4177.mp3", "Nam wants to buy a book; yesterday he bought two.": "audio/cau/9953418f62bdd3ef.mp3", "I have bread and milk for breakfast.": "audio/cau/52bab63d80c6e149.mp3", "Mum bought a loaf of bread at the bakery.": "audio/cau/3fb4b6c8304d8552.mp3", "We play games at break time.": "audio/cau/d7be6e5b8ac32945.mp3", "Be careful not to break the cup; Nam broke one yesterday.": "audio/cau/cb188b00dfe78e80.mp3", "Hoa is a bright student.": "audio/cau/505049821b13285a.mp3", "The sun shines brightly on a bright morning.": "audio/cau/8688428d91bd1a20.mp3", "Please bring your English book tomorrow.": "audio/cau/cd49561735d6690b.mp3", "Exams can bring about a lot of stress.": "audio/cau/4bcd1f108e558b55.mp3", "I brush my teeth twice a day.": "audio/cau/8ff559c0973a1814.mp3", "Lan uses a new toothbrush to brush her teeth.": "audio/cau/fa181f8fc7a47c61.mp3", "Her family runs a small business in Hue.": "audio/cau/5535eee598660a8f.mp3", "He started a business and now he is a businessman.": "audio/cau/0fd271a26ee50825.mp3", "My uncle is a successful businessman.": "audio/cau/f0ac2a2960c3b45f.mp3", "Many businessmen and businesswomen came to the meeting.": "audio/cau/843f693ed8691d3e.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is a bustling city.": "audio/cau/3597bb53664f0dd1.mp3", "The market is bustling, but my street is quiet.": "audio/cau/f2c456603c67155d.mp3", "My mum is always busy at weekends.": "audio/cau/e860f8923617b0aa.mp3", "Hoa is busy today, but she is free tomorrow.": "audio/cau/1d5a0a62fb11072c.mp3", "I want to buy a new lamp for my room.": "audio/cau/f0b3e6851a8b52eb.mp3", "Mum bought a sofa, and Dad wants to sell the old one.": "audio/cau/59add360cbe991b8.mp3", "The correct answer is c.": "audio/cau/115cc222c2d7fb6e.mp3", "Look at picture c and describe the girl.": "audio/cau/a211a53ea5c1cc24.mp3", "How about making a cake for Mum's birthday?": "audio/cau/ac3dd076cc4a499c.mp3", "Lan cuts the birthday cake into eight pieces.": "audio/cau/7f8f4245673c165e.mp3", "My grandmother makes delicious cakes for Tet.": "audio/cau/7ff5ebfe11b08973.mp3", "Lan ate one cake, and Nam ate two cakes.": "audio/cau/21ca197e77dd3aaa.mp3", "My village is calm and green.": "audio/cau/bc7c091bd908318d.mp3", "The streets are calm and quiet at night.": "audio/cau/2a74b9e92030e5a3.mp3", "The first iPhone came in 2007.": "audio/cau/b74af45c313ce91a.mp3", "Lan came to my house, and then we went to the park.": "audio/cau/db2ce9de70166e15.mp3", "Mi can swim very well.": "audio/cau/3e8edac082144330.mp3", "I can ride a bike now, but last year I couldn't.": "audio/cau/af33705bbc26781d.mp3", "I can't find my pencil case.": "audio/cau/eb6d0d717595fc1e.mp3", "Nam can swim, but he can't play the guitar.": "audio/cau/7d46b51b1e362522.mp3", "A friend of yours cannot get a good night's sleep.": "audio/cau/44dd417be1715182.mp3", "I cannot hear you. It's too noisy.": "audio/cau/c25f8e78a3e62ab2.mp3", "My grandmother is kind and caring.": "audio/cau/a03423bedfa41d41.mp3", "Hoa is caring. She takes care of her little sister.": "audio/cau/7cc44adf2286a858.mp3", "They carried out a study about city life.": "audio/cau/741e882cd91f0aed.mp3", "The old buses carried many passengers.": "audio/cau/1d29e18f669abb89.mp3", "Can you help me carry this box?": "audio/cau/a0f121aef5c03fe7.mp3", "Lan carried her books, and today she carries her bag.": "audio/cau/e736c67580379245.mp3", "One good teacher can change your life.": "audio/cau/a24566287e5a310e.mp3", "The city changed a lot, and the change is good.": "audio/cau/c2d3e45906274d36.mp3", "The trip changed her ideas about life.": "audio/cau/da028a9e62cf7a21.mp3", "My village changed after the new road was built.": "audio/cau/f31b9b1d46f2277f.mp3", "There are many changes in my hometown.": "audio/cau/5842dc08b691ba71.mp3", "Our town has made big changes, like new parks.": "audio/cau/d966270acb3214fd.mp3", "I often chat with my neighbours.": "audio/cau/f9bdc10e4250f241.mp3", "Mi and Lan had a long chat after school.": "audio/cau/92771962baaa6db3.mp3", "Mi checked her work, and the check took ten minutes.": "audio/cau/53e04ae5ad0ce9eb.mp3", "Every child in the village goes to school.": "audio/cau/9f966cc92f3b2d70.mp3", "When he was a child, he lived with his grandparents.": "audio/cau/5f1982ddb057760f.mp3", "She has three children and two grandchildren.": "audio/cau/41e17d5597e264f0.mp3", "One child was quiet, but the other children were noisy.": "audio/cau/863bff50c6e9f303.mp3", "There are forty students in my class.": "audio/cau/69f347ac209b4fc2.mp3", "Nam is my classmate. We are in the same class.": "audio/cau/e6a0aa2aaff4be27.mp3", "Nam is my new classmate.": "audio/cau/8f038868644223fc.mp3", "My classmate and I sit in the same classroom.": "audio/cau/ebc5ea3d6e23a8ba.mp3", "Our classroom is on the second floor.": "audio/cau/c460b559d453bdeb.mp3", "My classmates and I clean the classroom on Fridays.": "audio/cau/9cf5ce52e3da16c8.mp3", "Minh is a clever boy.": "audio/cau/620f8c5f3017a282.mp3", "Lan is clever. She answers the questions cleverly.": "audio/cau/2720a9ae3428f690.mp3", "Wear a warm coat when it is cold outside.": "audio/cau/d5e8abe0718f528b.mp3", "Lan forgot her coat and caught a cold.": "audio/cau/47f6fc0e90e11519.mp3", "I came down with a cold last week.": "audio/cau/6589d8d2056f15e9.mp3", "It is cold in Ha Noi in winter.": "audio/cau/6af5e5587fe6cf7a.mp3", "What colour is her hair?": "audio/cau/e7aa61d42982634f.mp3", "My favourite colour is blue, and my room is colourful.": "audio/cau/65b041dfbe52909f.mp3", "My bedroom has colourful walls.": "audio/cau/5480caf95b688723.mp3", "Each colour is bright, so the picture is colourful.": "audio/cau/c94ba14044838a90.mp3", "Please come to my birthday party.": "audio/cau/6800288294234b0b.mp3", "Nam came to school early yesterday.": "audio/cau/e4484967a289b802.mp3", "Success comes from hard work.": "audio/cau/104997cf355813ab.mp3", "Minh comes to school early, but yesterday he came late.": "audio/cau/8fc163a4c3b546e2.mp3", "My new friend is coming to my house.": "audio/cau/364032ec5fb1b2d1.mp3", "Lan came yesterday, and Hoa is coming today.": "audio/cau/2a3f62b0b9c0734e.mp3", "She works for a computer company.": "audio/cau/dbaa7b1a7f381505.mp3", "His company is now a big business.": "audio/cau/8c1460aeda0ca27f.mp3", "Complete the sentences with the words.": "audio/cau/a10abe8427f587a5.mp3", "Mi completed her homework. Now it is complete.": "audio/cau/e89d49e3a54806e8.mp3", "The project must be completed by Friday.": "audio/cau/a36434b8b918f435.mp3", "Lan completed her homework before dinner.": "audio/cau/9932d454a78dd897.mp3", "Lan completely forgot her friend's birthday.": "audio/cau/ae968fd2ecb01b87.mp3", "Minh completely forgot about his homework.": "audio/cau/4ec9cda7a9209eb1.mp3", "Nam plans his time well to ensure timely completion of his project.": "audio/cau/dc9f46bca5bd24cf.mp3", "After the completion of the test, Hoa felt relaxed.": "audio/cau/8159d955f47b0ba3.mp3", "My mum and I cook dinner in the kitchen.": "audio/cau/099d18a7b607e37e.mp3", "Dad is a good cook, and he loves cooking.": "audio/cau/ad61c98703aba283.mp3", "There's a cooker in the kitchen.": "audio/cau/ccb1cac6fa236187.mp3", "Mum is cooking rice on the cooker.": "audio/cau/2fb33fad1e4bbdd3.mp3", "Mi is cooking lunch now.": "audio/cau/cdaf6ad6f2a96daf.mp3", "My dad cooks well, and he is cooking fish today.": "audio/cau/656e2272945939a2.mp3", "Mi likes chocolate ice cream.": "audio/cau/c84c0f2dd81bf7e8.mp3", "This cake is soft and creamy because it has lots of cream.": "audio/cau/b2717da1ed8edc05.mp3", "Lan creates a to-do list every Sunday evening.": "audio/cau/87a26e3235a8f368.mp3", "Our class created a poster about healthy living.": "audio/cau/97dc8c8a67b315e5.mp3", "Hoa is very creative in art class.": "audio/cau/d1a85d15ebb2ea7b.mp3", "Nam is creative. He likes to create new games.": "audio/cau/a92d851d2aed43a0.mp3", "Art lessons help students show their creativity.": "audio/cau/ef2eb572bc331261.mp3", "Phong is creative, and his creativity makes our class fun.": "audio/cau/c91d4b0dff266adb.mp3", "Look left and right before you cross the road.": "audio/cau/ab3734d3c0b8be05.mp3", "Minh crosses the street at the zebra crossing.": "audio/cau/7bcca857b74d8810.mp3", "Turn left at the crossroads.": "audio/cau/aef9c9d81411fe2d.mp3", "Cross the road carefully at the crossroads near our school.": "audio/cau/c3a655f78d85696e.mp3", "Look at picture d and answer the question.": "audio/cau/cd1db823a64876e3.mp3", "Choose answer d, then write it in your notebook.": "audio/cau/d8924058670ef40e.mp3", "My dad is a doctor.": "audio/cau/87de43de098d8ab6.mp3", "My dad cooks dinner, and my mum washes the dishes.": "audio/cau/8ca0dad82745ad96.mp3", "Traffic jams are part of daily life in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/c95ad670d219bd23.mp3", "Nam reads the news daily, every day before school.": "audio/cau/7ddb05aad387c96a.mp3", "It is dark outside now.": "audio/cau/48eaca11c1014cbe.mp3", "Minh's room is dark, so he turns on the light.": "audio/cau/8c6105f992faba73.mp3", "I have English every day.": "audio/cau/50a9802d88a8dbc0.mp3", "Nam studies by day and sleeps at night.": "audio/cau/0f498730d8ee8697.mp3", "There are seven days in a week.": "audio/cau/4193126d14e614a3.mp3", "I study English daily, even on busy days.": "audio/cau/f6f890f7b3bda2bf.mp3", "We decorate our classroom for Tet.": "audio/cau/1231d380f79d0466.mp3", "Mi decorates her room with paper decorations.": "audio/cau/473aee58bf1a0f20.mp3", "The decoration on the wall is beautiful.": "audio/cau/2b0cca99468134b6.mp3", "We decorate the peach tree with red decorations.": "audio/cau/9c9b4c56a50eaef6.mp3", "I did my homework last night.": "audio/cau/52c1dc6ad84a16a5.mp3", "Did you do the project? Yes, I did.": "audio/cau/ce2a17ba3a5d2ade.mp3", "Maths is difficult for me.": "audio/cau/16bb57fb47e5df02.mp3", "This test is difficult, but that one is easy.": "audio/cau/56b22511f0d64b7c.mp3", "I dislike noisy and crowded places.": "audio/cau/5ace2bb2616bf75c.mp3", "Mi likes cats, but she dislikes dogs.": "audio/cau/a21ccd81f7c8d400.mp3", "I do my homework after dinner.": "audio/cau/dfa2558950305f83.mp3", "Phong did his homework, and now it is done.": "audio/cau/4e496982963ec9df.mp3", "Does Lan like ice cream?": "audio/cau/15298c934c7dedf6.mp3", "Nam does his homework, but he doesn't watch TV.": "audio/cau/16100881d98fba74.mp3", "Mi doesn't like milk very much.": "audio/cau/63a58b0dc618ef2d.mp3", "Nam does his homework, but Minh doesn't do it.": "audio/cau/362bb11ca0696388.mp3", "What are you doing now?": "audio/cau/cc6dbef7715013a7.mp3", "Lan is doing her homework, and she did the maths yesterday.": "audio/cau/c6619d790ec63e61.mp3", "I don't like rainy days.": "audio/cau/111328217b7f4b84.mp3", "We don't play games, but Minh does.": "audio/cau/851ce9fc9da85e82.mp3", "I have done my homework.": "audio/cau/319d28fa8d112271.mp3", "Nam did the test well; he has done a great job.": "audio/cau/a6f61635ce93b0e4.mp3", "Please close the door when you leave.": "audio/cau/afff0ef664915359.mp3", "Our house has a big front door and a small gate.": "audio/cau/609f4be9be5f1a33.mp3", "Please sit down on the chair.": "audio/cau/08cb6a07df1ed303.mp3", "The cat jumps up and then comes down.": "audio/cau/009acd9ad7b1a705.mp3", "Can you draw a cat?": "audio/cau/be2932fbc93e80e5.mp3", "Hoa drew a flower and gave me the drawing.": "audio/cau/8ef26c64079b1115.mp3", "Lan's drawing is on the wall.": "audio/cau/e1c99913c9bb1dcf.mp3", "Minh draws well. He drew this drawing yesterday.": "audio/cau/a06a821e60587e14.mp3", "My brother draws pictures of animals.": "audio/cau/f72f002c0ce9c3b5.mp3", "Mi draws every day, and last week she drew a horse.": "audio/cau/c53f78fbfbf3ff78.mp3", "Let's have a drink at the café after school.": "audio/cau/dc9a76d30b64d22b.mp3", "Lemon tea is my favourite drink in summer.": "audio/cau/3212a757a68580db.mp3", "The café sells cold drinks.": "audio/cau/0722a5f397e41546.mp3", "We ordered two drinks: lemon tea and coconut juice.": "audio/cau/e574c03a2082e523.mp3", "Life in the countryside can be dull for some teens.": "audio/cau/0347cee2d305ff73.mp3", "The film was dull, but the book was exciting.": "audio/cau/8b56307431aca227.mp3", "Mi makes friends easily at school.": "audio/cau/eedb13c811943ed4.mp3", "The test was easy, so I finished it easily.": "audio/cau/7cb7e2c3342cf293.mp3", "This English exercise is very easy.": "audio/cau/708befc5d340e6e4.mp3", "This question is easy, but that one is difficult.": "audio/cau/6ec1dbc0277d41ef.mp3", "We eat rice every day.": "audio/cau/e1b9f1e0ff973ad1.mp3", "We eat rice today, but yesterday we ate pho.": "audio/cau/575ec69b6a817f1a.mp3", "Parents encourage children to read books.": "audio/cau/e023715e37fdca1c.mp3", "My teacher's encouragement makes me want to try harder.": "audio/cau/0c43bb2e98cce98e.mp3", "Give your friends encouragement before a test.": "audio/cau/353f7ccbf193aeeb.mp3", "Thanks to her teacher's encouragement, Mai joined the contest.": "audio/cau/d478168aaa26d53d.mp3", "At the end of the story, he became a hero.": "audio/cau/4cef74a2fd4fb11a.mp3", "We read to the end, and the ending was happy.": "audio/cau/fc827bfa0e26aa94.mp3", "The story has a happy ending.": "audio/cau/a0aee1d6e11c4150.mp3", "The film ends well because it has a happy ending.": "audio/cau/f95c78e65af90c48.mp3", "I enjoy living in the city.": "audio/cau/1cc10e53aebeec12.mp3", "We enjoy the trip because it is very enjoyable.": "audio/cau/1a682a8a24ff63b3.mp3", "Cooking is an everyday activity for my mum.": "audio/cau/03801a514b91f476.mp3", "We use everyday English every day at school.": "audio/cau/61f0eab70fe5dd6e.mp3", "Look at the example first.": "audio/cau/738e63739d26fe10.mp3", "Give an example; for example, cat is a noun.": "audio/cau/dc9ac2f421dfc6ef.mp3", "Here are some examples of jobs.": "audio/cau/0e78185dc14a10fb.mp3", "Read each example; the examples are easy.": "audio/cau/434391c1dcb8488d.mp3", "Lan is very excited about the school trip.": "audio/cau/4e01ac39890b7f7f.mp3", "Nam was excited when his friends visited his home.": "audio/cau/5f58aa62d7076582.mp3", "City life is exciting for teens.": "audio/cau/28945e456a70e4ca.mp3", "The trip was exciting, so we were very excited.": "audio/cau/53c60dbfd0e789cf.mp3", "Lan is interested in fashion and music.": "audio/cau/c16e6190025bd97d.mp3", "These fashionable clothes are popular with teens.": "audio/cau/99dcfa9981242c08.mp3", "My father is a doctor in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/ad3b88cec9d38c40.mp3", "Hoa's father and grandfather are both farmers.": "audio/cau/86e9c9df994f954c.mp3", "I finish my homework before dinner.": "audio/cau/4c12023029931700.mp3", "Hoa started the project in May and finished it in June.": "audio/cau/92423d5fe3d5c777.mp3", "Use the past simple for finished events.": "audio/cau/15e768d53722862d.mp3", "We finished our visual story yesterday.": "audio/cau/da44bbf9abdec66f.mp3", "Minh is finishing his science project now.": "audio/cau/937d910b371dd6d7.mp3", "After finishing her homework, Lan went to bed.": "audio/cau/37fc15713a29f794.mp3", "Lan gives her friend a beautiful flower.": "audio/cau/fa4bac5dc4a6c0ef.mp3", "There are many flowers in my grandma's garden.": "audio/cau/a14860aa91d79b28.mp3", "How about putting some flowers on the table?": "audio/cau/2b9b6c204f34cab8.mp3", "My grandma grows flowers in her garden.": "audio/cau/8e0ebaa5f0e0c564.mp3", "Phong plays football with his friends.": "audio/cau/9baf509a6408f617.mp3", "Nam likes football and watches it every weekend.": "audio/cau/617a4e3bf9b2e89d.mp3", "What do you do in your free time?": "audio/cau/561d82e572a21e67.mp3", "I am busy today, but I am free tomorrow.": "audio/cau/ed0144aa5c166e1b.mp3", "There is some milk in the fridge.": "audio/cau/5fbcf64ec9261d1b.mp3", "Put the fresh fish in the fridge, please.": "audio/cau/cd244989781db9da.mp3", "Lan is my good friend.": "audio/cau/dd872f787d0777d3.mp3", "My friend Minh is very friendly.": "audio/cau/4f7040d4f93a465f.mp3", "Our new teacher is very friendly.": "audio/cau/0062f01a22f8a341.mp3", "Nam is friendly and has many friends.": "audio/cau/1865a7313d83db0c.mp3", "Mi and Lan are good friends.": "audio/cau/4315a79df8d3aac1.mp3", "Nam is friendly, so he makes friends easily.": "audio/cau/50b0e863c6e406f4.mp3", "Our friendship is very important to me.": "audio/cau/01f0404c79a2081f.mp3", "Lan and Hoa are close friends; their friendship is strong.": "audio/cau/9389591d845cf52e.mp3", "I eat fruit every day.": "audio/cau/6471baf4645a9651.mp3", "Fresh fruit like mangoes and bananas is healthy.": "audio/cau/7c63484ea41b9637.mp3", "Viet Nam has many tropical fruits.": "audio/cau/555e63190e77ea6e.mp3", "Mangoes are my favourite fruit.": "audio/cau/539c08d26d25750d.mp3", "Write short notes, not full sentences.": "audio/cau/14bb97e16bb6d06a.mp3", "The bus was full, but the next one was empty.": "audio/cau/cfd981c78ac3d787.mp3", "After a good sleep, Lan is fully alert in class.": "audio/cau/e731cef6fdf5dd54.mp3", "Minh hasn't fully recovered from his cold.": "audio/cau/8cd54850c26f30ee.mp3", "The word 'garden' starts with the letter G.": "audio/cau/855344adad6266b6.mp3", "Please write a capital G on the board.": "audio/cau/090b2d929a80461a.mp3", "We play a game in our English class.": "audio/cau/f89d92956bddd8c5.mp3", "My brother is a gamer, and he loves this game.": "audio/cau/5869b678fdd00fcc.mp3", "Nam likes computer games, but his favourite game is chess.": "audio/cau/7f58cb7638af0917.mp3", "Let's meet at the school gate at 7 a.m.": "audio/cau/db65f9078c3fa850.mp3", "There are many motorbikes around the school gates.": "audio/cau/97a6324c5160cac8.mp3", "My friend gave me a book for my birthday.": "audio/cau/301ff487a1615458.mp3", "Lan gives gifts to friends; last year she gave me a pen.": "audio/cau/759dbf022fa0c89a.mp3", "I get up at six o'clock every day.": "audio/cau/0449db3f3777d108.mp3", "Mi got a letter from her pen friend yesterday.": "audio/cau/84f62d6a67e5f9cb.mp3", "Please give me your notebook.": "audio/cau/63fd3e27b3248933.mp3", "Hoa gives her mum flowers; yesterday she gave her a card.": "audio/cau/8a999a2635280ba0.mp3", "Lan finishes her project within the given time.": "audio/cau/e0a4a7e575000b77.mp3", "Our teacher has given us three tasks this week.": "audio/cau/cd0bbafcb1fa540b.mp3", "I go to school by bike.": "audio/cau/df5dcef1ab40916f.mp3", "We often go to the beach; last summer we went to Nha Trang.": "audio/cau/9dac5f396b6a209e.mp3", "Nam is good at maths.": "audio/cau/4fd3587c745c05a2.mp3", "Lan's English is good, but Mi's is better.": "audio/cau/d371c25a8502dc92.mp3", "I got stuck in a traffic jam and came home late.": "audio/cau/fffb27ec64b971e2.mp3", "Mi usually gets up at six, but today she got up at seven.": "audio/cau/787111ee3d018017.mp3", "My grandfather is 75 years old.": "audio/cau/aaac8af2aea80407.mp3", "My grandfather and grandmother live in Hue.": "audio/cau/a198eed6e615b9c6.mp3", "My grandma tells us stories every night.": "audio/cau/96809300e183923c.mp3", "Grandma and Grandpa live with us.": "audio/cau/8051252f03d98b36.mp3", "My grandmother makes conical hats by hand.": "audio/cau/fb6599cb79d9916d.mp3", "Lan calls her grandmother 'Grandma'.": "audio/cau/61992d8dfda62651.mp3", "Grandpa is reading the newspaper.": "audio/cau/d2d844236b1f3b5a.mp3", "Grandpa is my mum's father, and he is very kind.": "audio/cau/5f39a7c7669e2379.mp3", "My grandparents live in the countryside.": "audio/cau/14d9858e971da542.mp3", "Minh visits his grandparents; his grandfather has a farm.": "audio/cau/ff809b7d116e870e.mp3", "That's a great idea for our project!": "audio/cau/a54aafc7aa505f92.mp3", "We had a great time; the trip was wonderful.": "audio/cau/3dc3e9c44a5960ce.mp3", "The sky train runs above the ground.": "audio/cau/2e1e5a5f710d21bd.mp3", "The metro runs under the ground, so it is underground.": "audio/cau/912eb0d06b1f0084.mp3", "We have a special guest at our party.": "audio/cau/05de5285bd976b2b.mp3", "The host welcomes each guest at the door.": "audio/cau/96d18dffb9235971.mp3", "We had a great time at the camp.": "audio/cau/9119cf6bce83ae88.mp3", "I have breakfast at six, but yesterday I had it late.": "audio/cau/8a0bd1bf7d672961.mp3", "The maths test was very hard.": "audio/cau/0fd61471858155e3.mp3", "Minh works hard; he is a hardworking student.": "audio/cau/32c549e4a9f6fc13.mp3", "Lan is a hardworking student.": "audio/cau/5b3ff11d5293f4e5.mp3", "Nam is hardworking, and he never gets lazy.": "audio/cau/06cd2484f9437f49.mp3", "Lan has two brothers.": "audio/cau/3ee04272e80b66c1.mp3", "Nam has a new bike; he had an old one before.": "audio/cau/756f69898700b7f4.mp3", "I hate waiting for the bus in the rain.": "audio/cau/3f99a8ce5b4ab56c.mp3", "Nam likes city life, but he hates traffic jams.": "audio/cau/6300158d6a0d3117.mp3", "I have a cat and a dog.": "audio/cau/3942c510ddf250d4.mp3", "We have English today, and we had Maths yesterday.": "audio/cau/f53b658e1d0dc09e.mp3", "We are having lunch in the canteen.": "audio/cau/68be2432f9d1c150.mp3", "Lan is having fun because she has many friends here.": "audio/cau/955a8fc5bad8bd17.mp3", "Can you help me with my homework?": "audio/cau/59064ec1f34486d3.mp3", "Mi is helpful; she always helps her mum cook.": "audio/cau/82b6e08d58022ab1.mp3", "A street cleaner is a community helper.": "audio/cau/4e5627311f32688c.mp3", "The helper always helps old people cross the road.": "audio/cau/5d453af4870fad09.mp3", "The map is very helpful for tourists.": "audio/cau/01dfa6b6d0d2dc96.mp3", "Mi is helpful; she often helps her neighbours.": "audio/cau/28366edc55c3b71c.mp3", "Nam helps his father in the garden.": "audio/cau/872717d07d581517.mp3", "Lan is helpful, and she likes to help her friends.": "audio/cau/1681abe8d625bbeb.mp3", "My bedroom is here, next to the kitchen.": "audio/cau/38f5476965ee13ae.mp3", "Come here, Nam! Your bag is over there.": "audio/cau/1518838d605d3769.mp3", "My hobby is collecting stamps.": "audio/cau/51f9ebccb029db6b.mp3", "Nam has many hobbies, and his main interest is music.": "audio/cau/f50e4d89304a6442.mp3", "I go home at five o'clock.": "audio/cau/a74ab800c921a80b.mp3", "After school, Mi does her homework at home.": "audio/cau/ecaf6456acc0b85d.mp3", "Nam does his homework at home every evening.": "audio/cau/0c529025b7e7c4aa.mp3", "The host asks three teenagers about their lives.": "audio/cau/e9176dc0794241d7.mp3", "The host welcomes each guest to the show.": "audio/cau/5487c29e3fefc14c.mp3", "Our house is near the river.": "audio/cau/462620c6e9d42610.mp3", "Lan's house is big, so the housework takes a long time.": "audio/cau/ffae3b516fc16794.mp3", "Lan helps her mother with the housework.": "audio/cau/603758dd29202743.mp3", "I do housework at weekends, like cleaning the house.": "audio/cau/603861c40de6e77e.mp3", "Nam and Ba are eating ice cream.": "audio/cau/8187b98018baa52e.mp3", "Please put some ice in my drink.": "audio/cau/728830e39b5e64bd.mp3", "It's raining. Let's play inside.": "audio/cau/a8fe3fe27e17a1ac.mp3", "Lan opens the door and goes inside.": "audio/cau/1c88017fec65bbcc.mp3", "Music is his greatest interest.": "audio/cau/01ea6b9ecb917ed3.mp3", "Minh has an interest in history, so he is interested in museums.": "audio/cau/218a4f41f5587ba6.mp3", "She was interested in science from an early age.": "audio/cau/34d48dff42b1323f.mp3", "Lan is interested in the book because it is interesting.": "audio/cau/916ab5cb0684d54c.mp3", "City life is interesting but stressful.": "audio/cau/d3da66e08dd099e1.mp3", "The film is interesting, and everyone is interested in it.": "audio/cau/4a91c463480dae58.mp3", "My school is big and beautiful.": "audio/cau/d5765e25cafa0eea.mp3", "Today it is sunny, but yesterday it was rainy.": "audio/cau/ed1bcaf6501bfd0c.mp3", "Nam isn't at home now.": "audio/cau/064ea182a69f9ba0.mp3", "This is my bag, but that one isn't.": "audio/cau/93f1c4d3918a4422.mp3", "Girl A is wearing a red and white jacket.": "audio/cau/fe9776bbbf9990d2.mp3", "It's cold, so put on your jacket or a coat.": "audio/cau/a69adaeea2a59714.mp3", "Lan goes jogging three times a week.": "audio/cau/d6a1e1effa16fe2d.mp3", "My dad goes jogging around Hoan Kiem Lake.": "audio/cau/7990d1d87d0b854e.mp3", "The word 'kitchen' starts with the letter k.": "audio/cau/ac85fdd0f3c32f82.mp3", "Please write a capital K on the board.": "audio/cau/f5d61da2bd65aeef.mp3", "We should keep our streets clean.": "audio/cau/3f2dd8440f55f148.mp3", "Lan kept her old toys, and she still keeps them.": "audio/cau/d20c525ce8b90756.mp3", "It's a perfect present for kids aged between 10 and 15.": "audio/cau/0a1ccb836dfdb1d4.mp3", "The kids play in the park; children love it.": "audio/cau/30844ad30dbeea3e.mp3", "My teacher is very kind.": "audio/cau/a4408f8940b23d7a.mp3", "Hoa is kind to everyone, but her brother is sometimes unkind.": "audio/cau/92eef49a76085d2d.mp3", "The word 'lamp' starts with the letter l.": "audio/cau/c5e08a5413a4f66b.mp3", "Please write a capital L on the board.": "audio/cau/63173cda63a08912.mp3", "My house has a large garden.": "audio/cau/aca5eaaef305eea5.mp3", "Their house is large, and their garden is very big.": "audio/cau/58f11bb60767bcfb.mp3", "Students need to sleep at least eight hours a day.": "audio/cau/06d7a5fd2aadd1a8.mp3", "Nam has less homework than Mi, and Lan has the least.": "audio/cau/144df5d8b5b5a253.mp3", "Village life is less noisy than city life.": "audio/cau/00a225b39b028bcc.mp3", "I have little time, less than Mi; Nam has the least.": "audio/cau/310826397361a2bd.mp3", "Let me help you with your bags.": "audio/cau/41dd52ad0f012862.mp3", "Mum let me go out yesterday; she lets me go on Sundays.": "audio/cau/46fc2d4c33221e5d.mp3", "Let's go to the craft village!": "audio/cau/2c8a106859ac7f9e.mp3", "Let's make lanterns; let us start now.": "audio/cau/d804af85f9b3cff1.mp3", "Students read books in the school library.": "audio/cau/652b3f1867b52ca4.mp3", "The librarian helps us find books in the library.": "audio/cau/75a040e0524410b2.mp3", "He had a difficult life when he was young.": "audio/cau/0e2c7b87c896e8b7.mp3", "City life is busy, and people live very fast.": "audio/cau/c7a56b97906b19d2.mp3", "I like noodles very much.": "audio/cau/7557928354c11c4a.mp3", "I like cats, but I dislike spiders.": "audio/cau/bdd9c25c87fbc823.mp3", "Minh likes playing football.": "audio/cau/8b21f729dbeb8632.mp3", "Hoa likes music, but I like art.": "audio/cau/e9144dc6f8053afb.mp3", "My little brother is five years old.": "audio/cau/e22af4e6bb3d77f0.mp3", "I have a little money, but my sister has less.": "audio/cau/520fdc680c743ed9.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City is very lively at night.": "audio/cau/f7f9de50246fc30a.mp3", "The market is lively and busy in the morning.": "audio/cau/be87297ba2d5a7fc.mp3", "Bat Trang pottery is a famous local product.": "audio/cau/ea08f150b9375ac4.mp3", "Many locals buy food from local farmers at the market.": "audio/cau/dfc3f008f3837ff1.mp3", "Look at the board, please.": "audio/cau/512572a71fea8cfe.mp3", "Look at Minh! He is very good-looking today.": "audio/cau/3a8f3a88e8a3813b.mp3", "Nam looked at the old photos of his village.": "audio/cau/57a1a25de6c14b73.mp3", "She looked tired yesterday, but today she looks happy.": "audio/cau/72e5fb4099eea871.mp3", "Mi is looking for her notebook in the bedroom.": "audio/cau/9cf0853b1a840504.mp3", "Look! Nam is looking at the picture on the wall.": "audio/cau/debf12a72a75e3eb.mp3", "Mi looks happy today.": "audio/cau/d53ae1b2afc27fcb.mp3", "Look at Nam; he looks tired.": "audio/cau/b6b16cdb7526bf98.mp3", "Mai has a lot of friends at school.": "audio/cau/5010f52a3a68ba0b.mp3", "Minh reads a lot, and he has lots of books.": "audio/cau/356256a0d64c06ca.mp3", "There are lots of books in our school library.": "audio/cau/3190c7d803a13870.mp3", "Phong has lots of friends and a lot of free time.": "audio/cau/4a66fae37e042e36.mp3", "Please don't be loud in the library.": "audio/cau/b4956ef2c49e1b40.mp3", "Nam has a loud voice, and he sings loudly.": "audio/cau/956ffd4ad9cd7167.mp3", "I love my family.": "audio/cau/02c5061798cc56cc.mp3", "My grandma is loving, and I love her a lot.": "audio/cau/588e4f5967e2076b.mp3", "My mother is a loving person.": "audio/cau/5a0aadfbccb5dec1.mp3", "Hoa has a loving family, and she loves them a lot.": "audio/cau/dbfb0082905aad2d.mp3", "You are lucky to have kind friends.": "audio/cau/1a666c0109b4ac0c.mp3", "Nam was lucky, but Phong was unlucky in the game.": "audio/cau/32cb15ff61c73704.mp3", "I'm a student at Nguyen Du High School.": "audio/cau/fc4e40becc452649.mp3", "I'm happy because I am with my best friends.": "audio/cau/70dc61c954d001ef.mp3", "He made his first computer in a small garage.": "audio/cau/ab57132318aeca10.mp3", "This vase is made of clay; people make it in Bat Trang.": "audio/cau/e23523961a9ed154.mp3", "Hard work can make your dreams come true.": "audio/cau/b31d6220b696ab85.mp3", "He made many mistakes, but he learnt to make good choices.": "audio/cau/f95abe45aba09ae8.mp3", "My mum goes to the market every morning.": "audio/cau/404c687061df1fa4.mp3", "We buy fruit at the market, not at the supermarket.": "audio/cau/c7167a7fa9212397.mp3", "What does 'craft village' mean?": "audio/cau/4c5a16ea9baf9474.mp3", "What do these words mean? Let's check their meaning.": "audio/cau/2a235e867bbba30d.mp3", "I drink a glass of milk every morning.": "audio/cau/0c1e245cf760ba88.mp3", "Lan drinks two glasses of milk a day.": "audio/cau/51b5c5f3e52b164d.mp3", "Read the model story first.": "audio/cau/96d5d11b4bc02327.mp3", "My father is my role model.": "audio/cau/d6cd0d28b863f1d8.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City has many modern buildings.": "audio/cau/810253cd103ab3c9.mp3", "The old town is traditional, but the new area is modern.": "audio/cau/f96ce31b6ef5078e.mp3", "She saved money to buy a new bike.": "audio/cau/47b199504b22fee6.mp3", "Don't waste money; save some money every month.": "audio/cau/6545086d5613a2d1.mp3", "My mother is a nurse.": "audio/cau/7504a7ce3f463355.mp3", "Mi's mother, her mum, cooks very well.": "audio/cau/4860342249a4a0b1.mp3", "My mum works in a hospital.": "audio/cau/6797efc1f7e404e7.mp3", "I love my mum; she is a kind mother.": "audio/cau/9c8b3cd7b9c8ebfc.mp3", "In 'running', we double the letter n.": "audio/cau/f2d3227ba2e63feb.mp3", "Run ends in n, so we write running with two n's.": "audio/cau/840a0ecac7ac2b05.mp3", "We need more parks in the city.": "audio/cau/fa790aed3aa20742.mp3", "Plants need water, and Mi needs some help.": "audio/cau/43af483482c3e17f.mp3", "The village needs a new bridge.": "audio/cau/1beac53452ba3355.mp3", "Nam needs a pen, and I need one too.": "audio/cau/bd84b90357a9da88.mp3", "He started a new life in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/c5e37434302d9841.mp3", "This bike is new, but that one is old.": "audio/cau/dae26bf3d19dc70a.mp3", "I watch the news on TV every evening.": "audio/cau/4eec6079f4f4c6a3.mp3", "The news is good: a new park is open.": "audio/cau/c4024e28c9bf5003.mp3", "Nice to meet you, Mai.": "audio/cau/7c4c4da145e9a59d.mp3", "Lan is nice, and she always speaks nicely.": "audio/cau/b93deacf2eeac62d.mp3", "The city is noisy at night.": "audio/cau/003950b6dbcd9d77.mp3", "We went out last night, so tonight we stay at home.": "audio/cau/334224d67553dca2.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City has an exciting nightlife.": "audio/cau/db63b206001cd606.mp3", "The nightlife here is lively, and the streets are busy at night.": "audio/cau/3d60979904eca10a.mp3", "There is too much noise from the traffic.": "audio/cau/618afe734d9580d5.mp3", "The noise is loud, and the street is very noisy.": "audio/cau/71cde03703f63654.mp3", "Our street is noisy because of the traffic.": "audio/cau/c625fc467757080e.mp3", "The city is noisy, but my village is quiet.": "audio/cau/63c66e344ab53850.mp3", "She did not give up her dream.": "audio/cau/b5d39e3052bc5fbb.mp3", "I am not tired, and I'm not hungry.": "audio/cau/9485504d93b05a38.mp3", "The verb 'do' needs an object.": "audio/cau/39d543adf72c24e9.mp3", "In 'I love music', 'music' is the object.": "audio/cau/695391fd78ce8c91.mp3", "The museum has many old objects.": "audio/cau/201afc5bf6d316fc.mp3", "This object is a vase, and those objects are bowls.": "audio/cau/b51c136317a63816.mp3", "Turn off the lights when you leave.": "audio/cau/3a68f3ab6e248006.mp3", "Turn on the fan, but turn off the TV.": "audio/cau/bdd957c99adde5f0.mp3", "My grandfather is seventy years old.": "audio/cau/ad4ec0973ce447a3.mp3", "My bike is old, but my sister's bike is new.": "audio/cau/dc292ece9d402a3f.mp3", "My brother is older than me.": "audio/cau/5670535468e3c19f.mp3", "This house is old, but that house is older.": "audio/cau/854d4f823994b96e.mp3", "I eat an orange every morning.": "audio/cau/282f40b8a70cf81c.mp3", "Lan drinks orange juice and wears an orange T-shirt.": "audio/cau/0878b53e2573456c.mp3", "Mi went out with her friends last night.": "audio/cau/6662db3eac9ce4e0.mp3", "Nam wants to find out more about his grandfather's life.": "audio/cau/c2c4b3120ecb6468.mp3", "The city has many outdoor markets.": "audio/cau/70f031e665dcb6a3.mp3", "Phong likes outdoor sports, so he often plays outdoors.": "audio/cau/62d7cb3e1f835b37.mp3", "My friends and I like playing outdoors.": "audio/cau/b93328230ef90e2f.mp3", "It's sunny today, so let's eat our lunch outdoors.": "audio/cau/5f24f91daf666c75.mp3", "The film starts at 8 p.m.": "audio/cau/5b3d11f7cb5bec98.mp3", "School finishes at 4.30 p.m., and I have dinner at 7 p.m.": "audio/cau/6193e0ae396e4d78.mp3", "I need a new pair of shoes for school.": "audio/cau/250c1c4ccfb0d448.mp3", "Find a partner and work in pairs.": "audio/cau/9f9cc8d6f86e7886.mp3", "Work in pairs and ask each other questions.": "audio/cau/2bae203d74ef1339.mp3", "There are ten pairs, so each pair gets one card.": "audio/cau/6a0e4948c63a816b.mp3", "We need some paper for our project.": "audio/cau/f4afb5888591efee.mp3", "Hoa gives me a piece of paper to draw on.": "audio/cau/dcd887a17dc93953.mp3", "Every parent loves their children.": "audio/cau/f0f02e141cda079d.mp3", "My mum is a kind parent.": "audio/cau/fc0100e2293df4cc.mp3", "My parents are always kind and patient.": "audio/cau/f70296736693e0b8.mp3", "My dad is a busy parent, but my parents always eat dinner with us.": "audio/cau/02cfa7df92c1de83.mp3", "Ask your partner about his favourite food.": "audio/cau/422fdd4d69934397.mp3", "Minh is my partner, and we work in pairs.": "audio/cau/c79cf650c67747ae.mp3", "Life in the countryside is peaceful.": "audio/cau/95479ebba178019f.mp3", "The village is quiet and peaceful, not noisy like the city.": "audio/cau/c7f81daa39689185.mp3", "Can you take a photo of us?": "audio/cau/4e7337681afc841a.mp3", "This photo is a nice picture of my class.": "audio/cau/94f608c9dc656d2b.mp3", "Look at the photos of my friends.": "audio/cau/8a988a56d17dddc5.mp3", "Mi takes a photo, and Lan takes many photos.": "audio/cau/df1811e9acc25b9a.mp3", "'Look after' is a phrasal verb.": "audio/cau/af602eb955e2891a.mp3", "Learn each phrase and use the phrasal verbs in sentences.": "audio/cau/40a96f6869b52557.mp3", "Match each phrase with its meaning.": "audio/cau/557dd9e0b36c6f5f.mp3", "'Go out' is a phrasal verb, and 'in the city' is a phrase.": "audio/cau/ca722714e28c9b92.mp3", "Use these phrases in your presentation.": "audio/cau/4f40d1db291eb325.mp3", "Write one phrase from the box, then add two more phrases.": "audio/cau/f53433a3dd4c0563.mp3", "Look at the picture and describe the man.": "audio/cau/b1d73989f1f7619c.mp3", "Hoa draws a picture, and Nam takes a photo of it.": "audio/cau/40c2b9c3207a7713.mp3", "Mi draws beautiful pictures in art class.": "audio/cau/1037e2e30ff7fb85.mp3", "We took many photos and put the pictures on the wall.": "audio/cau/5ddc63bf192b9304.mp3", "There is a plant next to the window.": "audio/cau/ead07f80a6f49805.mp3", "Mi plants flowers and waters the plants every day.": "audio/cau/8379ade47936222a.mp3", "Plants need water and sunlight.": "audio/cau/e6bc337addd58412.mp3", "People make com from young rice plants.": "audio/cau/5ab8c23c4ad5e1eb.mp3", "Nam and Phong play football after school.": "audio/cau/4f990530a36010eb.mp3", "The children play in the playground at break time.": "audio/cau/01c38c5563b4ece0.mp3", "The children play football in the playground.": "audio/cau/ba97d8ec376ab1f4.mp3", "Lan and Hoa play games in the school playground.": "audio/cau/16841dfb20eb6b7d.mp3", "The community centre provided free lessons for children.": "audio/cau/5f9c54b68891da3e.mp3", "Libraries provide books for everyone.": "audio/cau/1a64bfbcc616fb7b.mp3", "Can I ask you a question, Ms Hoa?": "audio/cau/7e99e348210556f2.mp3", "Nam asks a question, and Mi gives the answer.": "audio/cau/269c53bfb0db8e6f.mp3", "The teacher asks us three questions.": "audio/cau/9e7c27a7a37e13a0.mp3", "Read the questions carefully and write your answers.": "audio/cau/7fcc03272c2a6124.mp3", "The library is a quiet place.": "audio/cau/cf5d391e8e881e58.mp3", "My village is quieter and more peaceful than the city.": "audio/cau/fe9afae0f73f7b97.mp3", "The word 'red' starts with the letter r.": "audio/cau/19d12f34975f740f.mp3", "'Rabbit' and 'room' both begin with R.": "audio/cau/aca28cd4f322eeb4.mp3", "I relax by reading books at weekends.": "audio/cau/7a14312dbb4ab728.mp3", "After school, I listen to music to relax.": "audio/cau/cb3ed8bfdce9e8f8.mp3", "Walking in the morning makes us feel relaxed.": "audio/cau/8a55a52b63802535.mp3", "Hoa feels relaxed after listening to music.": "audio/cau/a280c4ce5593c872.mp3", "How does Elena reply to her mum?": "audio/cau/dcaf59d7091175e8.mp3", "Please reply to my email soon.": "audio/cau/1fbb259adb0f0a8b.mp3", "If you don't feel well, you can stay at home and rest.": "audio/cau/80c50d7bcdc0aa2e.mp3", "Hoa rests for ten minutes after running.": "audio/cau/0e4d9ca9b895f037.mp3", "We eat rice with fish and vegetables.": "audio/cau/4e526d57f8bd93c3.mp3", "My village grows rice; the rice is very good.": "audio/cau/0533eb040c5c2035.mp3", "My room is small but very tidy.": "audio/cau/bd9658dea75a069a.mp3", "There are five rooms in my house.": "audio/cau/a28138f93ee20867.mp3", "I run in the park every morning.": "audio/cau/3fed1cc1643c52ce.mp3", "Mi ran very fast; she is a good runner.": "audio/cau/48f4e8245e306883.mp3", "The children are running in the schoolyard.": "audio/cau/cd547a363770b5c2.mp3", "Nam loves running, and he ran five kilometres today.": "audio/cau/f921a02636522e0b.mp3", "She's my best friend in class 6A.": "audio/cau/810592fcf73e04e7.mp3", "This is Vinh's bike, and he's in my class.": "audio/cau/6a8b8131a5222edf.mp3", "I said, can you pass me the book?": "audio/cau/e2db7c41d720581d.mp3", "The teacher said we should sleep early.": "audio/cau/f9528b768b823292.mp3", "Read the sample answer before you write.": "audio/cau/ea7645ef6a324d03.mp3", "This sample is a good example of a life story.": "audio/cau/c91d20f5c55e871f.mp3", "What do you say when you meet someone?": "audio/cau/ebd766cb7a0b37c7.mp3", "Say hello! Mi said hello to everyone.": "audio/cau/835b6b164eec79c4.mp3", "What is the artisan saying about his work?": "audio/cau/758a63f41cdaea82.mp3", "Grandpa said an old saying about hard work.": "audio/cau/dae1465b6bed02a4.mp3", "They sell fresh vegetables at the market.": "audio/cau/052ed543aa37b44c.mp3", "Grandma sold flowers; she was a kind seller.": "audio/cau/ea04b190084d53ff.mp3", "Write a sentence about your family.": "audio/cau/9ffdb94eb27ae024.mp3", "This sentence is short and easy to read.": "audio/cau/f99b7a9b5f47ebe1.mp3", "Please write five sentences about your best friend.": "audio/cau/9fbb8a8d97d0001d.mp3", "The first sentence is easy, but the other sentences are hard.": "audio/cau/8cf810890ade1eda.mp3", "Jobs and Wozniak set up Apple in 1976.": "audio/cau/48673803c7bf8992.mp3", "Mi set her alarm for six o'clock yesterday.": "audio/cau/92e32160df23e27c.mp3", "Let's go to the shop to buy a lamp.": "audio/cau/02d8310bb74af7bc.mp3", "There is a small shop near my house.": "audio/cau/e63a93ab9fc8033d.mp3", "My mum goes shopping on Sunday mornings.": "audio/cau/9edd7bc7a6da8213.mp3", "Mi likes shopping at the small shops near her house.": "audio/cau/9b5fc040769efc5a.mp3", "There are many shops along this street.": "audio/cau/f8d089fcbdb1b89b.mp3", "My aunt has a small shop near the school.": "audio/cau/d1a736005c66edb9.mp3", "You should eat more vegetables.": "audio/cau/d3873c12c668ddab.mp3", "We should recycle, and we shouldn't waste water.": "audio/cau/bdd4848df2193265.mp3", "You shouldn't stay up too late.": "audio/cau/680bdbc9338f8ccb.mp3", "You should sleep early and shouldn't skip breakfast.": "audio/cau/a2f566a8bdd973cf.mp3", "Phong signs out of social media when he starts work.": "audio/cau/acc4c6c6c64a10b2.mp3", "Lan signs out of her account every night.": "audio/cau/1bc5bbc513646bb2.mp3", "Use simple words in your presentation.": "audio/cau/685b89e962568275.mp3", "The task is simple; simply read and answer.": "audio/cau/f9dad5cdcce61ac9.mp3", "My house is small but cosy.": "audio/cau/361843b6d8177bed.mp3", "I live in a small flat, not a big house.": "audio/cau/e341afdae498f225.mp3", "Ha Noi is planning to become a smart city.": "audio/cau/534a2d2742fd455c.mp3", "My smart cousin made an app for smartphones.": "audio/cau/a451335c10c8aa7f.mp3", "He sold newspapers to help his family.": "audio/cau/7961f23e1eccf2f3.mp3", "Grandma sells fruit, and she sold everything today.": "audio/cau/eaf8d829433ac11f.mp3", "Which word has the sound /əʊ/?": "audio/cau/abdd497b61506cce.mp3", "I love the sound of the rain at night.": "audio/cau/6a34a72a03c00f3a.mp3", "Can you speak English well?": "audio/cau/7e70c8ed41dd5f73.mp3", "Mi spoke to her teacher after class.": "audio/cau/9631c4f9d08103cf.mp3", "Our head teacher gave a short speech today.": "audio/cau/d7f9999a0661fac2.mp3", "Mi will speak first, then Nam will give his speech.": "audio/cau/e7405c38166acf2a.mp3", "Football is the most popular sport in Viet Nam.": "audio/cau/a567791eb72955db.mp3", "Minh is very sporty; he plays sport every day.": "audio/cau/8f3a07ca267912a7.mp3", "My favourite sports are football and swimming.": "audio/cau/8a24f3303ec53899.mp3", "Badminton is a popular sport, and Nam loves all sports.": "audio/cau/76b12d75a3439875.mp3", "My sister is sporty and plays volleyball.": "audio/cau/e6b11ca23dbab79b.mp3", "Phong is sporty, so his favourite sport is football.": "audio/cau/4d26845d5c555def.mp3", "Our English lesson will start at eight.": "audio/cau/920ac7d03b952080.mp3", "We start at seven and finish at eleven.": "audio/cau/f8b0988a876acebc.mp3", "My grandfather started work when he was fifteen.": "audio/cau/9cd956a07a50d11d.mp3", "The film started at seven and finished at nine.": "audio/cau/7b234820845db47a.mp3", "Please stop talking and listen to me.": "audio/cau/14d99e9f18d5a441.mp3", "The bus will stop here and then start again.": "audio/cau/2af4e67bdadcfda0.mp3", "The store is near our house.": "audio/cau/499a1bc50d7cd647.mp3", "Let's go to the store this weekend.": "audio/cau/df90dc123d86e998.mp3", "If you eat too much sugar, you may put on weight.": "audio/cau/00bcdffee9539a79.mp3", "Mai drinks milk without sugar.": "audio/cau/d6171534c50b9bb9.mp3", "My mother goes to the supermarket on Saturdays.": "audio/cau/e0c35c378a30526b.mp3", "The supermarket is cleaner, but the market is cheaper.": "audio/cau/90cc7f9196a14fee.mp3", "Friends support each other in hard times.": "audio/cau/c25544ac51cf812c.mp3", "My parents are supportive; they always support me.": "audio/cau/bc09957a4f6cc0ae.mp3", "Are you sure about the answer?": "audio/cau/ef07776b14f2052d.mp3", "Nam is sure, but Mi is unsure about it.": "audio/cau/ab6bc930801198f7.mp3", "Eating too many sweets is bad for your teeth.": "audio/cau/f97ddce1cab10334.mp3", "This cake is too sweet, so I don't eat sweets often.": "audio/cau/bea21344401c59d8.mp3", "In \"don't\", the letter t comes from not.": "audio/cau/549e7bc5a2456c75.mp3", "I didn't go out because I was tired.": "audio/cau/5cc7479c1b749e64.mp3", "Don't forget to take your umbrella.": "audio/cau/d1c93b06561e343d.mp3", "I take the bus to school; yesterday I took a taxi.": "audio/cau/6de67298648ceb25.mp3", "I often talk to my grandma on the phone.": "audio/cau/30262ea1745db608.mp3", "Lan is talkative; she loves to talk and chat with friends.": "audio/cau/ef14453a567466fc.mp3", "Don't drink coffee or tea in the evening.": "audio/cau/dc61816ecff6c737.mp3", "My grandpa drinks green tea every morning.": "audio/cau/e84b80f1db559ba1.mp3", "Brush your teeth twice a day.": "audio/cau/ee6eed60012e074b.mp3", "My baby brother has one tooth, but I have many teeth.": "audio/cau/75510b49dadac6b7.mp3", "The traffic in the city is terrible today.": "audio/cau/01ea841928344884.mp3", "The food was terrible, but the view was wonderful.": "audio/cau/93b659e2b5f66a2e.mp3", "There is a big garden in my house.": "audio/cau/94db3c106fafa1ac.mp3", "Your bag is here, and my bag is over there.": "audio/cau/37204e4c7e951d02.mp3", "The most important thing is to be honest.": "audio/cau/c302c847e8e66725.mp3", "Something is wrong; one thing is missing from my bag.": "audio/cau/c14d87bcc3d6fc9b.mp3", "I put my things in my schoolbag.": "audio/cau/bf35bafff88418e4.mp3", "There are many good things at my school, not just one thing.": "audio/cau/26ddc5ba45fd5524.mp3", "I think he is a great person.": "audio/cau/9ae2e70b49a3159f.mp3", "I thought about his story, and I think it is true.": "audio/cau/9f8df7704c81c77d.mp3", "Tick the correct answers.": "audio/cau/03211fde6b6a3087.mp3", "Put a tick next to the things you did.": "audio/cau/579b575a47a252d1.mp3", "What time is it now, Mum?": "audio/cau/1cbca6b4e0afa66c.mp3", "Look at the timetable; it is time for maths.": "audio/cau/9b6fb48058293171.mp3", "Lan is going to bed early tonight.": "audio/cau/082a4a419bcc862e.mp3", "If you stay up late tonight, you might feel tired tomorrow.": "audio/cau/67679aa3684d9212.mp3", "I'm optimistic about the exam I took last week.": "audio/cau/98111979a0b1df4c.mp3", "Minh took the bus to school.": "audio/cau/d8fe913a07c52d8e.mp3", "My little brother lost a tooth today.": "audio/cau/4abb47921bdd0673.mp3", "I have a toothache, and two teeth hurt.": "audio/cau/292fc9b52a6c0b3e.mp3", "If you eat too many sweets, you might get toothache.": "audio/cau/520916d6f74ce52e.mp3", "Minh has toothache, so he goes to the dentist.": "audio/cau/2d90ad0136110f64.mp3", "The total cost of the trip was two million dong.": "audio/cau/521a6863d757906b.mp3", "We have thirty students in total.": "audio/cau/668ad1ace50950a6.mp3", "I totally agree with you.": "audio/cau/2ed025b410dc2507.mp3", "The town is totally different now; it changed completely.": "audio/cau/7c44b917714a1ef2.mp3", "A tourist asked me the way to the lake.": "audio/cau/85504a3dd570c415.mp3", "Tourism is important, and every tourist loves our pho.": "audio/cau/28ec58cef47dd36f.mp3", "Many tourists visit Hoi An every year.": "audio/cau/34e133dcd9a0fdd4.mp3", "The market attracts tourists and locals.": "audio/cau/4d4408900393fd12.mp3", "Bat Trang is famous for traditional pottery.": "audio/cau/af80d363c35bf8b2.mp3", "This tradition is old, but the shop is modern.": "audio/cau/a518363de6b74f38.mp3", "There are many old trees in my village.": "audio/cau/826dbf2b122a8fa0.mp3", "My grandfather planted this tree twenty years ago.": "audio/cau/dc3f88c985c7e66b.mp3", "Go straight and turn left at the corner.": "audio/cau/917966b2ec32c8a4.mp3", "A farm can turn food waste into biogas.": "audio/cau/52db34b37521af50.mp3", "This project turns food waste into energy.": "audio/cau/120924f8388b4ad5.mp3", "We turned old bottles into flower pots.": "audio/cau/36df7dee09156ada.mp3", "Ho Chi Minh City has some underground metro stations.": "audio/cau/fd268956dce8144e.mp3", "We took the underground to the city centre.": "audio/cau/8022bdb95be3059a.mp3", "Nam grew up in a small village.": "audio/cau/40830ead9e37bc73.mp3", "Lan walked up the hill and then came down.": "audio/cau/815acf6571d188ca.mp3", "We use computers to make our visual story.": "audio/cau/1f9e65093a2c0cf1.mp3", "This app is very useful, and I use it every day.": "audio/cau/7434eb2ec1577d85.mp3", "This dictionary is very useful.": "audio/cau/d616d82dd437efdf.mp3", "A computer is useful, but a broken one is useless.": "audio/cau/061aada006d6e574.mp3", "She is using a computer to write her story.": "audio/cau/c0867dfe4d3cf7aa.mp3", "Minh used a map yesterday, and today he is using his phone.": "audio/cau/2f51e71c740b9c6e.mp3", "How about + V-ing? How about going to the park?": "audio/cau/4bd32e061c4f1188.mp3", "In the formula, V means a verb, like 'go' or 'play'.": "audio/cau/2a5961c55ebdeb37.mp3", "'Play' is a verb, but 'happy' is not.": "audio/cau/7cb0163f6a27d0af.mp3", "Underline the verb in each sentence.": "audio/cau/c45fa8ec83b8ba93.mp3", "Write the -ing form of these verbs.": "audio/cau/9a8d4d3f46f1577e.mp3", "'Run' and 'swim' are verbs; can you find one more verb?": "audio/cau/1cd8c87f9c695ab7.mp3", "Visit our website for more information.": "audio/cau/ac9737600d9243d7.mp3", "Phong visited his grandparents, and they enjoyed his visit.": "audio/cau/24f2a12ad9734414.mp3", "Each visitor gets a free map.": "audio/cau/d13c12d782a36fe7.mp3", "Many visitors visit Hoi An every year.": "audio/cau/f97ffc3669fff0e8.mp3", "Bat Trang attracts many visitors.": "audio/cau/3b53ccd4a057d15e.mp3", "Visitors visit the craft village to buy pottery.": "audio/cau/364cd950cea318c5.mp3", "I walk to school every day.": "audio/cau/0a109a8251b16954.mp3", "Mi walked in the park and enjoyed her walk.": "audio/cau/f2ec11ed20a260e3.mp3", "Nam was at home yesterday.": "audio/cau/faca1649a4ef8a76.mp3", "I was tired, but my friends were happy.": "audio/cau/e3e7c2c50296c48e.mp3", "Can I have some water, please?": "audio/cau/e7f9c90ffdf43ef9.mp3", "Hoa waters the plants with rainwater.": "audio/cau/63d57a63a01495bc.mp3", "Workers wear helmets at work.": "audio/cau/58cc64267deb5ef1.mp3", "Mi usually wears jeans, but yesterday she wore a dress.": "audio/cau/23bb4a0107f750d1.mp3", "She is wearing a white T-shirt.": "audio/cau/2026d341ee2515db.mp3", "Nam wore jeans yesterday, but today he is wearing trousers.": "audio/cau/f93860f5b315d691.mp3", "The electrician wears a uniform.": "audio/cau/e61ef88174b570fe.mp3", "Lan wears glasses, and she wore them in the photo too.": "audio/cau/930bd22d0c295d4b.mp3", "Lan sings very well.": "audio/cau/8d831f0b90fa91ed.mp3", "Nam plays football well, but Phong plays better.": "audio/cau/7c13b2c077241009.mp3", "We went to the summer camp last June.": "audio/cau/577b7f143e454603.mp3", "Mi usually goes by bus, but yesterday she went by bike.": "audio/cau/bf4b0b541f770b47.mp3", "They were in Ha Noi last year.": "audio/cau/a884324b521a97cd.mp3", "I was at school, and my parents were at work.": "audio/cau/d6c97d0e9f2b3c05.mp3", "Write the new word in your notebook.": "audio/cau/8b8bb3be1461f910.mp3", "This word has two syllables.": "audio/cau/3c07a10113a0df79.mp3", "Learn five new words every day.": "audio/cau/adb2b8f5372e6050.mp3", "Match the words with the pictures, one word for each picture.": "audio/cau/0c015f99a499421d.mp3", "My parents work in a hospital in Ha Noi.": "audio/cau/4a34bda1f13dc400.mp3", "My uncle is a hard-working worker; he works every day.": "audio/cau/4fe31bc354d9e0c5.mp3", "The worker wears a helmet.": "audio/cau/9c235c7e97cd46ce.mp3", "Factory workers work long hours.": "audio/cau/dd3d0d4cd13eb0b4.mp3", "My mum is working in the garden now.": "audio/cau/0fc0a939dbaf61f1.mp3", "Dad works hard, and today he is working late.": "audio/cau/8fff1884b3def435.mp3", "Would you like to live here?": "audio/cau/648fc211b3b7e91a.mp3", "I would like a villa with a big garden.": "audio/cau/af8db0397bcb6281.mp3", "Lie becomes lying: change 'ie' to y and add -ing.": "audio/cau/ccd0d01ed2295121.mp3", "The word 'yellow' begins with the letter y.": "audio/cau/413244207833f8bd.mp3", "My uncle is young and active.": "audio/cau/25ab8c1b23e804a5.mp3", "Nam is younger than Minh, but they are both young.": "audio/cau/ae83efbb6b4f31bc.mp3", "My younger brother is eight years old.": "audio/cau/4f32791e715fc8a4.mp3", "Lan is young, and her sister is even younger.": "audio/cau/a298d4fd339450fa.mp3"};
